trong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> was always drawn from the side or from above.</li><li>unlikely that contact through <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> resulted in similar artistic styles</li></ul><p><b>Why our ancestors produced rock art</b></p><p>Research suggests rock art was produced</p><ul><li>firstly for reasons of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>later for social, spiritual and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> reasons.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":6},{"id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-g4-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 37-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Answer the questions below.</p><p>Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong> What TWO images drawn by Aboriginal people show their contact with Europeans? (1 of 2)</span><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong> What TWO images drawn by Aboriginal people show their contact with Europeans? (2 of 2)</span><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong> Which human activities does the lecturer say are the main threats to Aboriginal rock art? (1 of 2)</span><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong> Which human activities does the lecturer say are the main threats to Aboriginal rock art? (2 of 2)</span><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t5-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/official_cambridge_guide_to_ielts_academic_listening_test_5_4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-q1","part_id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-p1","group_id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"white","correct_answer_variants":["white"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3130180_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-q2","part_id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-p1","group_id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"office","correct_answer_variants":["office"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3130180_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-q3","part_id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-p1","group_id":"en-official-guide-t5-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"camera","correct_answer_variants":["camera"],"answerCoun